    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（23北京）从A地到B地是下坡路，一辆车从A地开往B地需要三小时，从B地开往A地需要四小时。已知这辆车下坡速度比上坡速度快15千米／小时，则A、B两地之间的距离是多少千米？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "120"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "180"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "240"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "300"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          68
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          62
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-01-p068.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（一） · 实战精刷1 · 讲义第62页",
            "pdfPage": 68
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们把路程设为S千米，下坡速度S/3，上坡S/4。速度相差15，所以S/3－S/4＝15。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "左边为S/12，得到S＝180千米，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "同路程给工时和速度差，直接用路程除各自时间列方程。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
