    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（24国考）甲和乙两辆车同时从A地出发匀速开往B地，甲车出发时的速度比乙车快20%，但乙车行驶2小时后速度加快30千米／小时继续匀速行驶，又用了3小时与甲车同时抵达。问A、B两地相距多少千米？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "540"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "510"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "600"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "570"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          68
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          62
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-02-p068.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（一） · 实战精刷2 · 讲义第62页",
            "pdfPage": 68
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s06-t03-drill-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设乙原速v，甲为1.2v。两车都用了5小时，甲路程6v；乙分两段，路程2v＋3(v＋30)＝5v＋90。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "同起点同终点，总路程相等，得到6v＝5v＋90，所以v＝90。距离为6×90＝540千米，选A。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "提速行程按阶段累加路程，用相同总路程联立。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
